comments:
Thanks for reporting.
I've been able to reproduce the issue on `samples/drivers/adc` (using V2.7.1) adding a nucleo_wl55jc.overlay with the following dts fragment:
```
/ {
	zephyr,user {
		/* adjust channel number according to pinmux in board.dts */
		io-channels = <&adc1 3>;
	};
};

&adc1 {
	pinctrl-0 = <&adc_in3_pb4>;
	status = "okay";
};
```

I've also managed to test it successfuly on [this branch](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/pull/34751) that introduced the ADC support for WL, so this is likely a regression. We'll have a look.
